From solderpunk@SDF.ORG Fri Aug 16 10:43:12 2019
From: solderpunk@SDF.ORG (solderpunk)
Date: Fri, 16 Aug 2019 10:43:12 +0000
Subject: File size issues
In-Reply-To: <20190815180620.GA18238@brevard.conman.org>
