It's nice to see another combined Gopher/Gemini client on the list.

I think the fact that Gemini documents can straightforwardly link out to
content on other protocols without resorting to hacks is one of its
nicer improvements over Gopher.  Clients which support both protocols
make it easier to take full advantage of that.

