It was thus said that the Great defdefred once stated:
> On Sunday, June 14, 2020 3:22 AM, Sean Conner <sean at conman.org> wrote:
> > [3] http://boston.conman.org/2019/07/09-12
> > http://boston.conman.org/2019/08/06.2
