        |                           .                          . 
        |                .                          .            
        |                          .                          .  
        |                 .                          .           
        |                         .                          .   
        |                  .     /                    .     /    
        |                   \   /                      \   /     
-0.9983 |                    ...                        ...      
          -6.28319                   0                          6.28319

In this case we seem to get the same result with ascii and unicode,
or maybe Sympy does not distinguish for plotting, although both
