A hat tip to Drew DeVault for nagging me about auto generating
certificates even before I was ready to make a proper announcement.

And much praise for solderpunk for keeping it simple and making me want
to write my own server, and of course the racket community for providing
an awesome platform to write software on.

I hope some of you will find d??m?ni useful.

Cheers,
R.

