Subject: [spec] What to do of fragments when there is a redirection
In-Reply-To: <20201222095950.GB24920@sources.org>
References: <20201222095950.GB24920@sources.org>
Message-ID: <CAD2gp_Sf7TiN3cP941pKybu_67hO4hNLm5mgyc-kcTEQNTUKuQ@mail.gmail.com>
