Subject: [spec] avoiding the transport layer security trap
Message-ID: <2DE8C080-4795-465E-9EBC-FF9CDF0F9372@gmail.com>
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit
