that they will remain zero-width, but will generate emojis when used in
special sequences, as with the flag of England:

🏴󠁧󠁢󠁥󠁮󠁧󠁿
=
🏴<U+E0067><U+E0062><U+E0065><U+E006E><U+E0067><U+E007F><U+E0042>

