From gemini-bounces@lists.orbitalfox.eu Thu Apr 8 02:35:41 2021
From: Sean Conner <sean@conman.org>
Date: Wed, 7 Apr 2021 22:35:41 -0400
Subject: Re: [spec] The updated speculative specification is now up
