I'd like to use Gemini as much as I can for my daily use, I wonder if all of us can work together to share comments and reviews of Places and Restaurants we love to go (or we don't love...) in order to make these information available through a simple search in Gemini, we might start creating in our capsule a page called something like the one below, which doesn't need to be necessarily shown on your root:

